<title>FRANCE: Lyonnaise 1996 sales 91.1 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Lyonnaise 1996 sales 91.1 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(All figures in billions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					91.1	vs   84.9</p>
<p>includes</p>
<p>     - services				   48.8	vs   42.8</p>
<p>     - communications			    1.6	vs    1.4</p>
<p>     - construction			     39.3	vs   39.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Lyonnaise des Eaux gave its 1996 sales in a statement.</p>
<p>It said 1995 figures are pro-forma and exclude asset sales in 1996 to reflect a like-for-like comparison. On that basis, sales rose 7.3 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
